(text "NUCLEO-H563ZI CAN interface - revision A" (at 20.32 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9f0e0e94-9d72-52ab-8724-5057c3656941"))
(text "Bench interface: MCP2562FD-E/SN, 5V VDD, 3V3 VIO; STBY tied low.\nJ1 cable: 1/6 GND, 2 +5V, 3 +3V3, 4 MCU TX (PD1), 5 MCU RX (PD0).\nST UM3115: CN8.9=5V, CN8.7=3V3, CN8.11=GND; CN9.27=PD1, CN9.25=PD0." (at 20.32 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "eba5c81f-fe1b-5fc3-9872-b26238526aa0"))
(text "D1 terminal mapping: 1 CANL, 2 CANH, 3 GND.\nPESD2CAN symbol is a functional pin block.\nPlace beside J2; ground return must be short." (at 162.56 79.756 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "cb0392b8-466b-59fa-b60d-00f0b021d9ed"))
(text "JP1 closed: 120 ohm H-L termination.\nFit at each physical bus end only.\nBench uses one remote tester with its own\n120 ohm termination; unpowered H-L ~60 ohm." (at 205.74 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c8f0e2bf-498a-5fdc-9fab-823bd908ad54"))
(text "60 x 40 x 1.6 mm PCB, two layers; M3 mounting pattern 52 x 32 mm.\nJST XH keyed removable harnesses. No galvanic isolation. USB CN1 is the only system power source.\nUse CAN-FD 500 kbit/s nominal / 2 Mbit/s data after physical firmware bring-up; no physical measurements recorded." (at 20.32 167.64 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fe69a4e-5c31-5a7a-8c8e-a3ae48aab7b8"))
(embedded_fonts no)
)
